# Comments?

So, as i venture into cyber world one more time today i finally discover that i too like everyone else on Wordpress have a comments section, where people can comment on your writing. Little to my knowledge did i know that i have people commenting on our blog and not because they love African Drumming but because they genuinely enjoy the blog posts by yours truely.  So, i am inspired to begin another roll of posts about whats going on in the real world alongside our rhythmic drumming world and even more excitingly Nathaniel will be leaving for Africa in 11 days and he will be posting in 'AfroKiwi Mali'. So, stay tuned for some excellent raw posts from Rhythm Culture. See you on the flipside :) or the Wordpress site.
